### Login user A -> saves annaToken
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "chef_anna",
  "password": "Demo-Pass-2026"
}

> {% client.global.set("annaToken", response.body.token); %}

### Login user B with email -> saves benToken
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "chef.ben@cuisine.test",
  "password": "Demo-Pass-2026"
}

> {% client.global.set("benToken", response.body.token); %}

### Wrong password -> 401
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "chef_anna",
  "password": "WrongPassword"
}

### Unknown user -> 401 (same message as wrong password, no user enumeration)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "nobody_here",
  "password": "WrongPassword"
}
